[Unit]
Description=RANDOM nightly check of the stored videos (05:50 Paris, after the night's last look-alikes and the sites' check, done before the 06:35 look-alikes: the dead are marked and hidden, the owner deletes them from his page)

[Timer]
OnCalendar=*-*-* 05:50:00 Europe/Paris
Persistent=false
RandomizedDelaySec=30

[Install]
WantedBy=timers.target
